DATA: NOT YET DETERMINED

**The BharatThermal-1 dataset is not released under this file and must not be
redistributed until the question below is settled.**

The feature matrix contains columns derived from OpenStreetMap, which is licensed
ODbL 1.0 and carries share alike on derivative databases. Whether the dataset as
constructed is a Derivative Database under ODbL section 4.4, which would require
share alike, or a Produced Work under section 4.5, which would not, has not been
resolved. `docs/audit/audit-licensing.md` sets out both readings with the licence
text quoted and states the four options. `context/DECISIONS.md` has no entry
resolving it because no human has decided.

Until it is decided, the dataset is not published and the intended CC BY 4.0
release is stated as an intention rather than a grant.

Separately, the EOG gas flare catalogue is recorded in this project's own
provenance table as redistribution not confirmed. Values derived from it are
coarsened to bands in the console export rather than published as distances,
because exact distances from many points are trilaterable back to the catalogue.
See D69.

UPSTREAM SOURCES AND THEIR TERMS

  NASA FIRMS               active fire detections, free and open, attribution requested
  OpenStreetMap            ODbL 1.0, attribution and share alike on derivative databases
  Global Energy Monitor    CC BY 4.0
  ESA WorldCover           CC BY 4.0
  EOG, Colorado School of Mines   attribution required, redistribution not confirmed
  Copernicus Sentinel-2    Copernicus data, free with attribution

Full attribution text is in README.md.
